edy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-22T16:43:45-08:00","id":1497868,"title":"","content":"An Apoptosome Fairest. All alone in the Never-Ending House, he constantly had to evade the horse-headed giants that invaded the Manor and sought him out. They would inflict horrors upon him if they caught him, but, he always crawled a new body out of a stove or fireplace 24 hours later. Even after escaping, horses <i>terrify</i> him.<br /> <br /> A Bricoleur Darkling.<br /> <br /> A Bridgeguard Fairest.<br /> <br /> A Ghostheart Ogre.<br /> <br /> A Glimmerwisp Wizened.<br /> <br /> A Hunterheart Wizened.<br /> <br /> An Oculus Elemental.<br /> <br /> A Wisewitch Beast. She was an SCA re-enactor, taken by the Brute and impressed with his Title as \u2018the Tireless Worker\u2019. Turned into a literal workhorse, she performed heavy lifting for her Keeper and her fellow slaves. Even after escaping, the Brute\u2019s Title remains inside her, driving her forward!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 11-29-2022, 01:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-23T14:19:37-08:00","id":1497950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_conta